@host = http://localhost:5182

### Customers. This is a no-tracking projection; the search runs in SQL.
GET {{host}}/customers?search=aroha
Accept: application/json

### Products
GET {{host}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Orders already in the database
GET {{host}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### Place an order for Aroha (customer 1). The console should show INSERT Orders and no UPDATE Customers.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Rename with ExecuteUpdate. One UPDATE, and the customer row is not loaded.
PATCH {{host}}/customers/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Nikau Rangi"
}
